--- !u!114 &440751185
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 440751179}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9d36a88429e08fe4cacbfeb06757ccc7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ConNuoc.UI.StoryPanelUI
  panelRoot: {fileID: 133195166}
  speakerText: {fileID: 1983753710}
  bodyText: {fileID: 646939458}
  nextButton: {fileID: 375703078}
  nextButtonLabel: {fileID: 564789969}
  nextLabel: Next
  lastPageLabel: Begin
  playIntroOnStart: 1
  openingPages:
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: "The River Remembers.\n\nIt's flood season in X\xF3m Sen, a stilt-house village on a Mekong Delta tributary. You are Mai, 13, and the water has always been part of your life."
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: This morning the road to school is under water again. Beside it, the drain is jammed with rubbish. It looks like a simple blockage, but you suspect it isn't.
  - speaker: "B\xE0 S\xE1u"
    text: 'Clearing one drain won''t change much, con. Talk to people: the farmers, the market, the commune. Each of them sees a different piece of it.'
  - speaker: "B\xE0 S\xE1u"
    text: What you can do alone is small. Together, and with the right people listening, it grows. Some of what you choose today will only show itself when the heavy rain comes.
  - speaker: How to play
    text: 'Move with WASD or the arrow keys.

      Press E near a villager to talk.

      Watch the three meters at the top: Ecology, Community and Resources.'
